WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.040
Kip was building a nest for himself.

2
00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:21.347
"Do you want some help?" asked Bird.

3
00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:25.124
"I'm very good at making nests."

4
00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:28.152
"No thanks, Bird," said Kip.

5
00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:31.636
"I'm sure I can build this nest myself."

6
00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:36.271
Kip worked on his nest.

7
00:00:36.272 --> 00:00:41.369
He didn't really know how to build one.

8
00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:49.475
But he did the best he could.

9
00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:53.295
Soon the nest was finished.

10
00:00:53.296 --> 00:00:56.118
"All done!" said Kip.

11
00:00:56.119 --> 00:01:00.919
Kip slowly climbed into the nest.

12
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.597
He carefully sat down.

13
00:01:03.598 --> 00:01:11.381
"Hmm," said Kip. "This doesn't seem very—"

14
00:01:11.382 --> 00:01:14.518
Smash!

15
00:01:14.519 --> 00:01:17.505
"Squawk!" cried Bird.

16
00:01:17.506 --> 00:01:20.719
"Sorry, Bird," said Kip.

17
00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.356
"Why do you need a nest?" asked Bird.

18
00:01:24.357 --> 00:01:26.898
"Don't you like your hole?"

19
00:01:26.899 --> 00:01:30.119
"I love my hole," said Kip.

20
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.848
"But . . . there's a problem."

21
00:01:33.849 --> 00:01:42.678
The two friends went up to the hole.

22
00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:46.013
Bird looked in and saw the problem.

23
00:01:46.014 --> 00:01:50.291
"Kip!" she cried.

24
00:01:50.292 --> 00:01:54.849
"Your hole is a mess!"
